    "market_commentary": "At 7,987 points, the SSY Pacific Capesize Index edged up 570 points in the week to 26 July. Meanwhile, the W.Australia-China iron ore spot voyage jumped $2.55/t to $13.40/t, the highest level since early May. The roundvoyage rate also rose to $2,150/day from $29,650/day.",
